---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="數位商店與訂閱服務 | Tommy Chen" 
  description="購買精美的高效能網站模板、下載免費 Figma 設計資源，或訂閱彈性的微型設計特助服務，省下高額的全職設計人力成本。"
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="py-20 px-6 relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0a0c]">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-brand/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4 relative z-10">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">數位商店 & 訂閱服務</h1>
      <p class="text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto text-base md:text-lg">
        即裝即用的專業開發資源與彈性的設計外包，助力新創快速推向市場。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pain Point Contrast Section -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 relative border-t border-dark-border bg-dark/40">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand">商務效益對比</h2>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">為什麼選擇「設計訂閱制」？</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Traditional Way -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-dark-card/30 border border-dark-border/60 space-y-6">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-400 flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span>✕</span> <span>雇用全職設計師</span>
          </h4>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-muted">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-red-400 mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>高昂的固定薪資：</strong> 月薪至少 6-8 萬台幣，且不論案量多寡皆需照常支付，加上勞健保、年終獎金。</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-red-400 mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>招募與訓練成本：</strong> 篩選履歷、面試到磨合期長達 1-3 個月，極消耗管理心力。</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-red-400 mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>工作閒置浪費：</strong> 沒有設計需求時，全職設計師人力閒置卻依然產生固定開銷成本。</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Subscription Way -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-brand/5 border border-brand/40 shadow-xl shadow-brand/5 space-y-6">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span>✓</span> <span>訂閱微型設計特助</span>
          </h4>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-white">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-brand mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>省下 70% 成本支出：</strong> 彈性按月付費，且隨時可以暫停或取消訂閱，讓預算做最靈活的配置。</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-brand mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>48 小時內快速交件：</strong> 無需等待招募與冗長會議，專案一鍵派發，平均在兩個工作天內即收到高質感設計。</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-brand mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
              <span><strong>無限次修改承諾：</strong> 在訂閱期間，您提交的任何修改需求將修改到滿意為止，絕無隱藏加收費用。</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Digital Products Section -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-dark-border">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand">數位素材與模板</h2>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">精選數位產品</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm font-medium">點擊商品即可呼叫模擬結帳燈箱（Gumroad 互動體驗）</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Lead Magnet (Free) -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card/20 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-semibold">免費誘餌 Free Magnet</span>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Figma 基礎網頁佈局元件庫</h4>
            <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              適合快速產出 Landing Page 的 Wireframe 套件。包含 30+ 模組化網格區塊與基礎按鈕、輸入框，為您的設計打下完美骨架。
            </p>
            <p class="text-2xl font-black text-white font-mono">$0.00 <span class="text-xs text-muted font-normal line-through ml-1">$15.00</span></p>
          </div>
          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="buy-btn w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border text-cyan-400 font-bold hover:bg-cyan-500/10 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all cursor-pointer"
            data-product-title="Figma 基礎網頁佈局元件庫"
            data-product-price="0.00"
          >
            $0 元免費下載
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Paid Template -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card/20 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 hover:border-brand/30 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand/10 text-brand text-xs font-semibold">熱門產品 Premium Asset</span>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Ultima Astro 個人作品集模板</h4>
            <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              專為接案設計師、工程師設計的極速靜態模板。預置 Tailwind v4 配置、聯絡表單、無縫過場動畫，Lighthouse 實測效能 100 分。
            </p>
            <p class="text-2xl font-black text-white font-mono">$29.00</p>
          </div>
          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="buy-btn w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white font-bold shadow-lg shadow-brand/20 transition-all cursor-pointer"
            data-product-title="Ultima Astro 個人作品集模板"
            data-product-price="29.00"
          >
            購買網頁模板 / Asset
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive Preview Component -->
      <div class="mt-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-dark-border/60 bg-dark-card/40 backdrop-blur-md">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand mb-6 text-center">產品動態預覽（互動調色盤 & 尺寸切換）</h4>
        
        <!-- Interactive Controller -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-dark-border/50">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted">切換寬度：</span>
            <button id="preview-btn-desktop" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand text-white text-xs font-bold transition-all">Desktop</button>
            <button id="preview-btn-tablet" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-dark border border-dark-border text-muted text-xs font-semibold hover:text-white transition-all">Tablet</button>
            <button id="preview-btn-mobile" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-dark border border-dark-border text-muted text-xs font-semibold hover:text-white transition-all">Mobile</button>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted">品牌色：</span>
            <button id="color-blue" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0052FF] border-2 border-white cursor-pointer" aria-label="Blue"></button>
            <button id="color-green" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981] border-2 border-transparent cursor-pointer" aria-label="Green"></button>
            <button id="color-orange" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B] border-2 border-transparent cursor-pointer" aria-label="Orange"></button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated Preview Screen -->
        <div class="flex justify-center transition-all duration-500">
          <div id="preview-screen" class="w-full max-w-full border border-dark-border bg-dark rounded-xl p-4 transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xl relative" style="height: 250px;">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-dark-border">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500"></div>
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></div>
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <!-- Top bar -->
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <div class="w-12 h-3 bg-dark-card rounded"></div>
                <div class="flex space-x-2">
                  <div class="w-6 h-2 bg-dark-card rounded"></div>
                  <div class="w-6 h-2 bg-dark-card rounded"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Hero section -->
              <div class="text-center py-4 space-y-3">
                <div id="preview-accent-block" class="w-16 h-1.5 bg-[#0052FF] rounded mx-auto transition-colors duration-300"></div>
                <div class="w-2/3 h-5 bg-dark-card rounded mx-auto"></div>
                <div class="w-[85%] h-2 bg-dark-card rounded mx-auto"></div>
                <button id="preview-accent-btn" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded bg-[#0052FF] text-[8px] font-bold text-white mx-auto block transition-colors duration-300">
                  CTA Action
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stripe Subscriptions Section -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-dark-border bg-dark/40" id="pricing">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand">按月委託方案</h2>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">選擇您的特助方案</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm font-medium">訂閱方案付款將安全地重定向至 Stripe 託管結帳網域。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pricing cards -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Starter Plan -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card/20 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8 hover:border-brand/20 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Starter 輕量訂閱</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">適合剛起步的微型公司或獨立創作者</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono">$999 <span class="text-xs text-muted font-normal">/ month</span></p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-muted">
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold">✓</span> <span>一次處理一個設計/開發請求</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold">✓</span> <span>平均 48 小時內快速交件</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold">✓</span> <span>無限次修改，直到滿意為止</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold">✓</span> <span>靜態網頁（Astro/Tailwind）與 UI 介面</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <a 
              href="https://checkout.stripe.com/mock-starter" 
              target="_blank"
              class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-dark border border-dark-border text-white hover:text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 group hover:border-brand/40 hover:bg-brand/5 transition-all"
            >
              <span>訂閱 Starter 方案</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-center text-muted italic">
              *Secure checkout powered by Stripe. You will be automatically redirected back after completion.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pro Plan (Highlighted) -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-brand bg-brand/5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8 relative shadow-2xl shadow-brand/5 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 right-6 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase text-white tracking-wider">
            最受歡迎 Most Popular
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Pro 全速訂閱</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand/90 mt-1 font-semibold">適合快速成長中的品牌與中小型企業</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono">$1,999 <span class="text-xs text-muted font-normal text-white/60">/ month</span></p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-white/90 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold bg-white text-brand w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">✓</span> <span>一次處理兩個設計/開發請求</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold bg-white text-brand w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">✓</span> <span>平均 24 小時內快速優先交件</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold bg-white text-brand w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">✓</span> <span>無限次修改 + 提供 Figma 與 React 原始碼</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="text-brand font-bold bg-white text-brand w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">✓</span> <span>專屬 Slack 溝通頻道，即時對接需求</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <a 
              href="https://checkout.stripe.com/mock-pro" 
              target="_blank"
              class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 group shadow-lg shadow-brand/30 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-all"
            >
              <span>訂閱 Pro 方案</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-center text-white/50 italic">
              *Secure checkout powered by Stripe. You will be automatically redirected back after completion.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section (Accordion) -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-dark-border">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand">問與答</h2>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">常見問題 FAQ</h3>
      </div>

      <!-- Accordion Grid -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <!-- Item 1 -->
        <div class="faq-item border border-dark-border rounded-xl bg-dark-card/25 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
          <button class="faq-toggle w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-white flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-dark-card/50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
            <span>設計特助的「訂閱制規則」是如何運作的？</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-muted transform transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content hidden p-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-dark-border/40">
            訂閱制非常簡單：一旦訂閱，您可以在看板提交無限個設計或開發需求。系統會根據您的方案（1或2個並行任務）排程處理。做完一個任務並經您確認通過後，我們便會立即啟動下一個排隊中的任務。您可以隨時取消或暫停訂閱，完全免除聘用全職人力的固定開銷。
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2 -->
        <div class="faq-item border border-dark-border rounded-xl bg-dark-card/25 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
          <button class="faq-toggle w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-white flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-dark-card/50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
            <span>每天可以提交多少修改？有上限嗎？</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-muted transform transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content hidden p-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-dark-border/40">
            完全沒有修改次數上限！在處理當前委託專案時，您對產出成果提出的任何回饋，我們都將不斷進行修改與調整，直到結果完全符合您的期待為止。
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3 -->
        <div class="faq-item border border-dark-border rounded-xl bg-dark-card/25 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
          <button class="faq-toggle w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-white flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-dark-card/50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
            <span>我可以隨時取消或暫停訂閱嗎？</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-muted transform transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content hidden p-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-dark-border/40">
            可以。當您在月中發現近期暫無設計需求時，您可以一鍵選擇暫停（Pause），剩餘的天數將會保留在帳戶中，等未來需要時再重新啟動（Resume）。若不再需要服務，亦可直接於 Stripe 客戶後台取消（Cancel）訂閱，下期即不進行扣款。
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 4 -->
        <div class="faq-item border border-dark-border rounded-xl bg-dark-card/25 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
          <button class="faq-toggle w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-white flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-dark-card/50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
            <span>如果不滿意，是否可以申請退款？</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-muted transform transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content hidden p-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-dark-border/40">
            由於我們提供的是高客製化的專業設計與代碼撰寫服務，在訂閱期間會投入大量人力工時進行深度客製，因此付費訂閱一旦生效後恕不提供退款服務。但我們保證會在訂閱期內，針對您的反饋進行無限次修改，直到您完全滿意為止。
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mock Gumroad Overlay Checkout Modal (Hidden by default) -->
  <div id="gumroad-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center hidden">
    <!-- Overlay backdrop -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm cursor-pointer" id="modal-backdrop"></div>
    
    <!-- Modal Box -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-dark border border-dark-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative z-10 mx-6 animate-scale-up">
      <!-- Modal Header -->
      <div class="p-5 border-b border-dark-border/60 bg-dark-card/40 flex items-center justify-between">
        <h5 class="font-bold text-white text-base">Gumroad 模擬安全結帳</h5>
        <button id="modal-close-btn" class="text-muted hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer text-sm p-1.5 hover:bg-dark-card rounded-md">✕</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Form View -->
      <form id="gumroad-checkout-form" class="p-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-xs text-brand font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">產品項目</p>
          <p id="modal-product-title" class="font-bold text-lg text-white">...</p>
          <p class="text-xl font-mono font-black text-white" id="modal-product-price">...</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Email -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <label for="checkout-email" class="text-xs text-muted font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">電子郵件地址 *</label>
            <input 
              type="email" 
              id="checkout-email" 
              required 
              placeholder="you@example.com" 
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-dark border border-dark-border text-white text-sm focus:border-brand focus:outline-none transition-colors"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Card Details (Only show if price > 0) -->
          <div id="payment-fields" class="space-y-3">
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <label for="checkout-card" class="text-xs text-muted font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">信用卡號 *</label>
              <input 
                type="text" 
                id="checkout-card" 
                placeholder="4242 4242 4242 4242" 
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-dark border border-dark-border text-white text-sm focus:border-brand focus:outline-none transition-colors"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <label for="checkout-exp" class="text-xs text-muted font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">有效期限 *</label>
                <input 
                  type="text" 
                  id="checkout-exp" 
                  placeholder="MM / YY" 
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-dark border border-dark-border text-white text-sm focus:border-brand focus:outline-none transition-colors"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <label for="checkout-cvc" class="text-xs text-muted font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">CVC 安全碼 *</label>
                <input 
                  type="text" 
                  id="checkout-cvc" 
                  placeholder="123" 
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-dark border border-dark-border text-white text-sm focus:border-brand focus:outline-none transition-colors"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button 
          type="submit" 
          id="checkout-submit-btn" 
          class="w-full py-4 rounded-xl bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-lg shadow-brand/25"
        >
          <span id="checkout-btn-text">確認結帳</span>
          <span id="checkout-btn-spinner" class="hidden w-5 h-5 border-2 border-white/30 border-t-white rounded-full animate-spin"></span>
        </button>
      </form>

      <!-- Success View (Hidden by default) -->
      <div id="checkout-success-view" class="hidden p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center space-y-6">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-brand/10 border-2 border-brand text-brand flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 animate-scale-up" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <h5 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">付款與下載成功！</h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
            系統已將下載連結與安裝說明發送至您的電子信箱。您也可以點擊下方按鈕直接下載。
          </p>
        </div>
        <a 
          href="/assets/mock-kit.zip" 
          download 
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white font-bold text-sm block w-full"
          id="checkout-download-link"
        >
          立即下載檔案
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    @keyframes scaleUp {
      from { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0; }
      to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    }
    .animate-scale-up {
      animation: scaleUp 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Interactive script for store page -->
  <script is:inline>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      // 1. FAQ Accordion Logic
      const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle');
      toggles.forEach(toggle => {
        toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const content = toggle.nextElementSibling;
          const icon = toggle.querySelector('svg');
          
          const isHidden = content.classList.contains('hidden');

          // Close all FAQ items
          document.querySelectorAll('.faq-content').forEach(el => el.classList.add('hidden'));
          document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle svg').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('rotate-185'));

          if (isHidden) {
            content.classList.remove('hidden');
            icon.classList.add('rotate-180');
          }
        });
      });

      // 2. Interactive Preview Customizer Logic
      const previewDesktop = document.getElementById('preview-btn-desktop');
      const previewTablet = document.getElementById('preview-btn-tablet');
      const previewMobile = document.getElementById('preview-btn-mobile');
      const previewScreen = document.getElementById('preview-screen');
      const previewAccentBlock = document.getElementById('preview-accent-block');
      const previewAccentBtn = document.getElementById('preview-accent-btn');

      const setWidth = (btn, widthClass, paddingClass) => {
        // Reset buttons
        [previewDesktop, previewTablet, previewMobile].forEach(el => {
          el.classList.remove('bg-brand', 'text-white');
          el.classList.add('bg-dark', 'border', 'border-dark-border', 'text-muted');
        });
        btn.classList.add('bg-brand', 'text-white');
        btn.classList.remove('bg-dark', 'border', 'border-dark-border', 'text-muted');

        // Set Screen Classes
        previewScreen.className = `border border-dark-border bg-dark rounded-xl p-4 transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xl relative ${widthClass}`;
      };

      if (previewDesktop && previewTablet && previewMobile && previewScreen) {
        previewDesktop.addEventListener('click', () => setWidth(previewDesktop, 'w-full', 'p-4'));
        previewTablet.addEventListener('click', () => setWidth(previewTablet, 'w-[450px]', 'p-3'));
        previewMobile.addEventListener('click', () => setWidth(previewMobile, 'w-[280px]', 'p-2'));
      }

      // Color select
      const blueBtn = document.getElementById('color-blue');
      const greenBtn = document.getElementById('color-green');
      const orangeBtn = document.getElementById('color-orange');

      const setAccentColor = (btn, hexColor) => {
        [blueBtn, greenBtn, orangeBtn].forEach(el => el.classList.remove('border-white'));
        btn.classList.add('border-white');

        if (previewAccentBlock && previewAccentBtn) {
          previewAccentBlock.style.backgroundColor = hexColor;
          previewAccentBtn.style.backgroundColor = hexColor;
        }
      };

      if (blueBtn && greenBtn && orangeBtn) {
        blueBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setAccentColor(blueBtn, '#0052FF'));
        greenBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setAccentColor(greenBtn, '#10B981'));
        orangeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setAccentColor(orangeBtn, '#F59E0B'));
      }

      // 3. Mock Gumroad Checkout Modal Logic
      const buyButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.buy-btn');
      const modal = document.getElementById('gumroad-modal');
      const modalClose = document.getElementById('modal-close-btn');
      const modalBackdrop = document.getElementById('modal-backdrop');
      const modalProductTitle = document.getElementById('modal-product-title');
      const modalProductPrice = document.getElementById('modal-product-price');
      const paymentFields = document.getElementById('payment-fields');
      const checkoutForm = document.getElementById('gumroad-checkout-form');
      const checkoutSuccess = document.getElementById('checkout-success-view');
      const checkoutBtnText = document.getElementById('checkout-btn-text');
      const checkoutSpinner = document.getElementById('checkout-btn-spinner');
      const checkoutSubmit = document.getElementById('checkout-submit-btn');

      if (buyButtons && modal) {
        buyButtons.forEach(btn => {
          btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const title = btn.getAttribute('data-product-title');
            const price = btn.getAttribute('data-product-price');

            modalProductTitle.textContent = title;
            modalProductPrice.textContent = `$${price} USD`;

            // If freebie ($0), hide card inputs
            if (parseFloat(price) === 0) {
              paymentFields.classList.add('hidden');
              checkoutBtnText.textContent = "免費下載";
            } else {
              paymentFields.classList.remove('hidden');
              checkoutBtnText.textContent = "確認結帳";
            }

            // Show Form and Hide Success State
            checkoutForm.classList.remove('hidden');
            checkoutSuccess.classList.add('hidden');

            modal.classList.remove('hidden');
          });
        });

        const closeModal = () => {
          modal.classList.add('hidden');
        };

        modalClose.addEventListener('click', closeModal);
        modalBackdrop.addEventListener('click', closeModal);

        // Checkout submit
        checkoutForm.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();

          // Loading spinner
          checkoutSubmit.disabled = true;
          checkoutSpinner.classList.remove('hidden');
          checkoutBtnText.textContent = "處理中...";

          setTimeout(() => {
            checkoutSpinner.classList.add('hidden');
            checkoutSubmit.disabled = false;

            // Show Success view
            checkoutForm.classList.add('hidden');
            checkoutSuccess.classList.remove('hidden');
          }, 1800);
        });
      }
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
